      "questions": [
        {
          "unit": 44,
          "body_index": 43,
          "issue": "The Chinese says 四项并列 after enumerating 沉静，幽深，端正，有条理，并且能让自己的士卒无知 (apparently five). German says the characteristics stand side by side without repeating the count. No author-level resolution proposed; confirm before forcing an inconsistent number into the translation."
